{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-10","no":"EP.10","tag":"第10話 · 正午演出作戰","title":"正午演出作戰","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-10:1","s":"n","t":"摩卡的地下廚房牆上貼起一張大紙，頂部歪歪扭扭寫著：正午演出作戰。","bg":"siksangNight","bgm":"siksangEnter","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:2","s":"yeon","t":"好，開會。目標是把太陽推到正午。","x":"excited","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"excited"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"calm"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-10:3","s":"moka","t":"聽一句童話就制定作戰的豬，我第一次見。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:4","s":"yeon","t":"那童話可是你提的。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:5","s":"neo","t":"準備三樣就好。高舞臺，一起唱的人，還有發出第一聲的勇氣。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-10:6","s":"yeon","t":"舞臺就選島上最高的，黑羽落下的那座。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:7","s":"moka","t":"日晷舞臺。以前每到正午就演出，現在是烏鴉窩。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:8","s":"yeon","t":"人我來召集，宣傳我有自信。","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:9","s":"moka","t":"禁歌的島上，你怎麼宣傳歌唱演出。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:10","s":"yeon","t":"不寫歌唱就行。正午免費烤串，這樣大家都來。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:11","s":"moka","t":"那些串誰烤。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:12","s":"yeon","t":"島上最會烤串的水獺，是誰來著。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-10:13","s":"neo","t":"聲音會變火的豬，居然要去宣傳。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:14","s":"yeon","t":"那個我會控制，大概。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-10:15","s":"moka","t":"那麼最後，誰發第一聲。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:16","s":"n","t":"Yeoni和Yeongnyangi同時看向摩卡。摩卡拿著湯勺往後退。"},{"id":"ep-10:17","s":"moka","t":"看我幹嘛。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:18","s":"yeon","t":"島上節奏最好的水獺，是誰來著。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:19","s":"moka","t":"都說是食譜了！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:20","s":"neo","t":"正午時念食譜，念到遠方也聽得見。","x":"soft","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 neo의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:21","s":"moka","t":"……貓，你原來也會開玩笑。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-10:22","s":"neo","t":"不是玩笑。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:23","s":"n","t":"Yeoni走向灰色市場。想召集人，得先見到人。","bg":"siksang2","tone":"desat","bgm":"memWater","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksang2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang2","transition":"crossfade","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:24","s":"n","t":"市場依舊安靜，巷口卻傳來小小的聲音。篤，篤篤。是筷子敲木箱。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"think"}},{"id":"ep-10:25","s":"yeon","t":"有聲音？還有沒被蓋印的人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:26","s":"n","t":"一個約十歲的男孩坐在箱前，手背乾淨，沒有印。他看見Yeoni，把筷子藏到背後。","r":null},{"id":"ep-10:27","s":"yeon","t":"別藏。我不是巡查隊，如你所見，是豬。","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-10:28","s":"n","t":"孩子看了Yeoni許久，噗地笑了，再敲起箱子。篤，篤篤，篤。"},{"id":"ep-10:29","s":"yeon","t":"節奏不錯，你打過鼓吧？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:30","s":"n","t":"孩子點頭，卻突然歪頭。表情像想不起是什麼時候打過。"},{"id":"ep-10:31","s":"yeon","t":"叫什麼名字？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:32","s":"n","t":"孩子的嘴張開又閉上，再張開，沒有任何名字出來。"},{"id":"ep-10:33","s":"yeon","t":"沒事。想不起來，以後再說也行。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:34","s":"neo","t":"孩子，你媽媽或朋友怎麼叫你？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:35","s":"n","t":"孩子聳肩，像不懂這麼簡單的問題，自己為什麼沒答案。"},{"id":"ep-10:36","s":"n","t":"孩子想用手指在箱上寫什麼，劃出第一筆後停住，不知道第二筆該往哪走。","sfx":"heartbeat","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang2","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang2 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:37","s":"neo","t":"Yeoni，看孩子的手腕。","x":"serious","c":{"who":"neo","x":"serious"}},{"id":"ep-10:38","s":"n","t":"孩子腕上有金線痕跡，像曾綁上線又剪斷，留下細傷疤，還殘留一點金色。"},{"id":"ep-10:39","s":"neo","t":"這是債線被切斷的痕跡，可名字也一起斷掉了。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-10:40","s":"yeon","t":"我好像知道是誰幹的。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-10:41","s":"n","t":"Yeoni想起地下舞臺地上的那縷金線，同樣的顏色。"},{"id":"ep-10:42","s":"yeon","t":"那我先給你個稱呼。鼓隊長，怎麼樣？","x":"smile"},{"id":"ep-10:43","s":"n","t":"孩子瞪圓眼，隨後用最大的聲響敲箱。篤，篤，咚。"},{"id":"ep-10:44","s":"yeon","t":"是喜歡的意思吧？鼓隊長，正午和我們一起演出吧。","x":"laugh","fx":"heart","sfx":"drum","scene":{"background":"siksang2","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang2","transition":"hold","tone":"desat","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"heart","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang2 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-10:45","s":"n","t":"海邊山丘。Yeongnyangi坐在岩石上開始授課，學生是一頭豬、一隻水獺、一個鼓隊長。","bg":"siksang3","bgm":"innerFlame","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:46","s":"neo","t":"用火有兩種方式，一是食神，一是傷官。","x":"lecture","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"},"c":{"who":"neo","x":"lecture"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-10:47","s":"yeon","t":"喔，終於開技能樹了？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:48","s":"neo","t":"沒有樹，只有串。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:49","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi示意摩卡。摩卡把六串放上烤網。"},{"id":"ep-10:50","s":"neo","t":"先食神。把火送向串，不要生氣，只想著變好吃。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-10:51","s":"yeon","t":"變好吃吧。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:52","s":"n","t":"Yeoni朝烤網伸出前蹄，什麼也沒發生。再伸，一串稍微熱了。"},{"id":"ep-10:53","s":"moka","t":"溫吞吞。端給客人，會得一星。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:54","s":"yeon","t":"你知道你現在在我心裡點火嗎？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:55","s":"n","t":"剎那間，六串一起捲入火焰，轉眼成了炭。","fx":"fire","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"fire","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:56","s":"moka","t":"我的串！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:57","s":"neo","t":"那就是傷官。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:58","s":"yeon","t":"呃，抱歉。一生氣，就全衝出去了。","x":"shy"},{"id":"ep-10:59","s":"neo","t":"是同樣的火，只是心看的方向不同。再來。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-10:60","s":"n","t":"又六串擺上去。Yeoni閉眼，想起奶奶的小吃攤，給唱不好的客人兩串的奶奶。"},{"id":"ep-10:61","s":"n","t":"烤網上響起醬油收汁聲，串均勻地變得金黃。摩卡拿一串嚐了嚐。","sfx":"sparkle"},{"id":"ep-10:62","s":"moka","t":"……四星。","x":"moved"},{"id":"ep-10:63","s":"yeon","t":"四星？為什麼不能五星？","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:64","s":"moka","t":"五星是我奶奶的，別覬覦。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:65","s":"neo","t":"接著傷官。傷官是刃，刃須用得精準而集中。只切斷那根繩。","x":"lecture"},{"id":"ep-10:66","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi指向岩石邊懸著的繩，繩尾掛著空鍋。"},{"id":"ep-10:67","s":"yeon","t":"用話切斷對吧，一句話？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:68","s":"neo","t":"用最短、最準的話。","x":"calm"},{"id":"ep-10:69","s":"yeon","t":"斷開！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:70","s":"n","t":"兩個火字飛出，削掉繩旁的岩石，把鍋打飛，落入海裡。繩完好無損。","fx":"claw","scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"claw","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:71","s":"moka","t":"那鍋是奶奶的！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:72","s":"yeon","t":"今天奶奶的遺物犧牲太多了。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-10:73","s":"n","t":"Yeoni又喊十次，第九次終於割斷繩。鼓隊長敲箱，咚，咚。"},{"id":"ep-10:74","s":"neo","t":"行了，記住剛才的感覺。","x":"soft","sfx":"drum"},{"id":"ep-10:75","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi起身時踉蹌了一下，正是右前爪落地時。牠若無其事地又坐下。","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:76","s":"yeon","t":"Yeongnyangi，腿麻了？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:77","s":"neo","t":"貓坐久了也會麻。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:78","s":"moka","t":"貓幾歲了？","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:79","s":"neo","t":"別問。","x":"deadpan"},{"id":"ep-10:80","s":"yeon","t":"原來是老爺爺貓。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:81","s":"neo","t":"說了別問。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:82","s":"moka","t":"現在輪到我了吧，練習。","x":"base","bgm":"daily","scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-10:83","s":"yeon","t":"喔喔，食譜朗讀彩排！","x":"excited"},{"id":"ep-10:84","s":"n","t":"摩卡爬上岩石。豬、貓、孩子抬頭望著，牠張開嘴。"},{"id":"ep-10:85","s":"n","t":"沒有聲音出來。不是因為印，摩卡手上沒有印。"},{"id":"ep-10:86","s":"moka","t":"……閉眼，大家。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:87","s":"yeon","t":"就我們三個看也不行？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:88","s":"moka","t":"三個最可怕，鍋不會盯著我。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:89","s":"n","t":"鼓隊長從包裡拿鍋蓋擋住臉，Yeoni也照做，Yeongnyangi用前爪遮眼。"},{"id":"ep-10:90","s":"moka","t":"醬油兩匙，糖一匙。火要猛，心要柔。","x":"base","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksang3","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksang3","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksang3 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:91","s":"n","t":"聲音很小，卻有節拍。鼓隊長在蓋後拍膝，Yeoni的尾巴隨著節奏搖。"},{"id":"ep-10:92","s":"yeon","t":"看吧，隔一隻鍋蓋就行了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:93","s":"moka","t":"正午要叫全島人都拿鍋蓋擋臉？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:94","s":"yeon","t":"也不錯啊，鍋蓋慶典。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-10:95","s":"n","t":"黃昏絲毫不動的傍晚，Yeoni抱著傳單走巷子。傳單只畫圖：太陽、烤串、笑臉。","bg":"siksangNight","bgm":"crisis2","shot":"wide","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"crossfade","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:96","s":"n","t":"巷口一盞燈滅了。Yeoni停步，現在知道這個順序了。","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"base"}},{"id":"ep-10:97","s":"tiger","t":"傳單挺可愛，畫技兩星。","x":"talk","r":{"who":"tiger","x":"base"},"fx":"veil","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"veil","camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 tiger의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-10:98","s":"yeon","t":"別給別人宣傳物評分。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:99","s":"tiger","t":"正午演出，傳遍了，烏鴉也知道。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:100","s":"yeon","t":"……這麼快？","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-10:101","s":"tiger","t":"這島上，傳聞比歌快。歌被禁，傳聞沒禁。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-10:102","s":"n","t":"黑虎打開帳本，裡面一行空白，最上方寫著Yeoni的名字。"},{"id":"ep-10:103","s":"tiger","t":"所以提個建議，借你掌聲。正午會有一千人在臺下為你鼓掌。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:104","s":"yeon","t":"一千人？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:105","s":"tiger","t":"掌聲夠大，太陽也會升。唱得生疏些也無妨，保證。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-10:106","s":"n","t":"Yeoni望著帳本，空白那行閃光。看起來容易，容易得過分。"},{"id":"ep-10:107","s":"yeon","t":"利息呢？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:108","s":"tiger","t":"現在也會問這種事了。","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:109","s":"yeon","t":"在地下舞臺學的，學費是Yeoul姐的聲音。","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:110","s":"tiger","t":"以後再定，對你便宜點。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:111","s":"yeon","t":"不要。","x":"angry","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:112","s":"n","t":"黑虎的尾巴停了。"},{"id":"ep-10:113","s":"yeon","t":"靠借來的掌聲升起的太陽，還債時又會落下吧。那這座島就得一輩子給你付利息。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:114","s":"yeon","t":"再生疏，也要用真正的掌聲托起它。不升，明天再唱。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-10:115","s":"tiger","t":"……也許不會有明天呢？","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-10:116","s":"yeon","t":"你在擔心我？","x":"think"},{"id":"ep-10:117","s":"tiger","t":"談生意而已。客人消失，帳本就空了。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:118","s":"yeon","t":"那今天唱好不就行了。","x":"grin"},{"id":"ep-10:119","s":"n","t":"黑虎合上帳本，聲音比平常稍響。","sfx":"thud","im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"natural","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:120","s":"tiger","t":"債欠著就會長，沒欠下的也一樣。拒絕的代價，我另收。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-10:121","s":"tiger","t":"還有，Yeoni。今晚別上屋頂。","x":"talk"},{"id":"ep-10:122","s":"yeon","t":"什麼意思，警告還是威脅？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-10:123","s":"n","t":"沒有回答。燈再次亮起時，巷裡已空無一人。"},{"id":"ep-10:124","s":"n","t":"那夜Yeoni睡不著，輕輕推開地下廚房的蓋子，爬上屋頂。越不讓做的事，越好奇。","bg":"siksangNight","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"quiet","l":null,"c":null,"r":null,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:125","s":"yeon","t":"只練一次，很小聲。","x":"calm","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"calm"}},{"id":"ep-10:126","s":"n","t":"Yeoni望向日晷舞臺，哼起歌。sol到mi，正是被網吊在法庭時遭嘲笑的音高。莫名心情很好。"},{"id":"ep-10:127","s":"n","t":"哼歌將結束時，無月的天又黑了一塊。是翅膀。","sfx":"heartbeat"},{"id":"ep-10:128","s":"crow","t":"讓正午舞臺響起的聲音。","x":"base","r":{"who":"crow","x":"base"},"im":true,"scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 crow의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-10:129","s":"crow","t":"沒收。","x":"alt"},{"id":"ep-10:130","s":"yeon","t":"等等，判決只能在法庭，不對，原來沒這種法律。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-10:131","s":"n","t":"烏鴉張嘴，一根光線從Yeoni喉中抽出，以sol和mi的形狀顫動，被吸入面具裡。","fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":"suck","camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:132","s":"n","t":"Yeoni想喊，氣息經過喉嚨，卻什麼也沒出來。"},{"id":"ep-10:133","s":"n","t":"烏鴉飛走。屋頂上只剩一頭豬和一根黑羽。","bgm":"none","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-10:134","s":"n","t":"下面響起開蓋聲，Yeongnyangi正爬上來。Yeoni喊牠。"},{"id":"ep-10:135","s":"n","t":"Yeongnyangi。嘴形分明這樣動了，卻沒有一點聲音。","im":true,"shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"siksangNight","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: siksangNight","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"siksangNight 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}}]}
